        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mabel Murphy Smythe-Haith\n- Organizations: Alabama State University, Standard Life Insurance Company\n- Places: Montgomery, Alabama\n- Topics: historically black universities\n\nFacts:\n- Alabama State University was founded in 1867.\n- Alabama State University is a historically black university in Montgomery, Alabama.\n- A man mentioned on the Mabel Murphy Smythe-Haith page later moved to what is now Alabama State University.\n- The man stayed at Alabama State University for several years before accepting a job with Standard Life Insurance Company.\n- The man accepted a job with Standard Life Insurance Company to organize and run its printing division.",
